    "intro_narrative": "You find yourself trapped in the subterranean workshop of the infamous Clockwork Alchemist. The room is filled with the hiss of escaping steam, the rhythmic ticking of countless gears, and the heavy scent of oiled brass. The Alchemist has vanished, leaving his most prized invention sealed inside the Grand Alchemical Vault at the center of the room. To escape this labyrinth of cogs and pistons, you must navigate a complex web of steam-powered machinery and mechanical analytical engines. Various contraptions lie dormant around the room, waiting for the correct sequences to hum back to life. Your objective is to decipher the workshop's interconnected systems, process the necessary data through these arcane machines, and ultimately disengage the master locks of the vault before the central boiler reaches a critical limit.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
